The following originate from that upstream project (renamed and lightly
adapted for this release):

  - the guest-lounge storage layer (lib/store.js)
  - the default LLM adapter (lib/llm-claude-cli.js)
  - the guest visitor/admin HTTP routes (lib/guest-routes.js)
  - the example host skeleton (server.js)

Everything else in this repository — the multi-room chat system
(lib/mcp-room.js), the MCP-native room tools, read cursors and unread
counts, webhooks (lib/webhooks.js), the token-minting tool (tools/mint.js),
and the room front end (lib/room-page.html, lib/room-ui/) — is new work
added for this project (Pier) and is not part of the upstream atrio release.

